<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<%- include ('head'); %>
<%- include ('navbar'); %>

    <body>
      <%- include ('header'); %>
      <!-- BOOTSTRAP -->
      <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.2.3/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js"
        integrity="sha384-kenU1KFdBIe4zVF0s0G1M5b4hcpxyD9F7jL+jjXkk+Q2h455rYXK/7HAuoJl+0I4"
        crossorigin="anonymous"></script>
      <!-- MDB -->
      <script type="text/javascript"
        src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/mdb-ui-kit/8.2.0/mdb.umd.min.js"></script>
      <!-- MASONRY: adjusts grid layout -->
      <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/masonry-layout@4.2.2/dist/masonry.pkgd.min.js"
        integrity="sha384-GNFwBvfVxBkLMJpYMOABq3c+d3KnQxudP/mGPkzpZSTYykLBNsZEnG2D9G/X/+7D" crossorigin="anonymous"
        async></script>
      <script type="module" src="./js/index.js"></script>
      <!-- Container for p5.js sketch -->
      <div id="dotsSketchContainer">
        <script src="sketches/dots.js"></script>
      </div>
      <div id="homeSection" class="px-2 py-2 my-2 text-center">
        <h1 class="display-5 fw-bold">Welcome!</h1>
        <div class="col-lg-6 mx-auto">
        </div>
      </div>
      <!-- TODO update text -->
      <!-- thematic breaks -->
      <hr class="my-3" />
      <div class="container mt-4 mb-4">
        <% if (projectArray.length > 0) { %>
          <% const randomIndex = Math.floor(Math.random() * projectArray.length); %>
          <% const randomProject = projectArray[randomIndex]; %>
          <div>
            <%- include('projectCard', { 
              id: randomProject.id, 
              image: randomProject.img_url, name: randomProject.project_name,
            projectDescription: randomProject.project_description }); %>
          </div>
        <% } else { %>
          <p>No projects available.</p>
        <% } %>
      </div>
      <!-- thematic breaks -->
      <hr class="my-3" />
      <div id="aboutSection" class="container col-xxl-8 px-4 py-5">
        <div class="row flex-lg-row-reverse align-items-center g-5 py-5">
          <div class="col-10 col-sm-8 col-lg-6">
            <img src="images/sketch_24087d_7.png" class="d-block mx-lg-auto img-fluid"
              alt="image of the artist's work, a lime green background with multiple orbs surrounding a enourmous orb"
              width="700" height="200" loading="lazy" />
            <img src="images/sketch_24087d_7.png" class="d-block mx-lg-auto img-fluid"
              alt="image of the artist's work, a lime green background with multiple orbs surrounding a enourmous orb"
              width="700" height="200" loading="lazy" />
          </div>
          <div class="col-lg-6">
            <h1 class="display-5 fw-bold lh-1 mb-3">About Rukiya</h1>
            <p id="aboutText" class="lead">
              Once upon a time, in the magical world of creation, there existed a
              legendary creature known as Pink Pegasus! This mythical being didn’t
              just gallop through the realms of full-stack software
              development—they soared across the vast landscapes of art and
              technology. A true multidisciplinary artist, they conjured wonders
              with code, 3D modeling, physical hardware, photography, digital art
              forms, VR/AR, and anything else they could get their hands on. With
              a sprinkle of fun and a dash of spirit, they left a trail of
              innovation and joy in every medium they touched. Their dazzling
              creations seamlessly fused web applications, APIs, third-party
              integrations, and databases with artistic expression. This
              extraordinary creature wasn’t just talented—they were organized,
              collaborative, and infused every project with harmony and laughter.
              Their magical charisma enchanted media outlets and industry leaders
              alike, sharing tales of their artistic and software engineering
              adventures through captivating presentations and delightful
              conversations. So, embrace your inner pegasus and let the magic of
              creation—across every form—begin!
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <%- include ('footer'); %>
    </body>

</html>